{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "NCEPNCAR_Pressure_loader",
    "description": "Pure-I/O data loader for NCEP/NCAR Reanalysis 1 pressure-level fields (6-hourly air temperature, geopotential height, vertical velocity, and horizontal winds) on the native 2.5°×2.5° global longitude/latitude grid with 17 standard pressure levels, from NOAA PSL.\n\nThis is the time-varying loader half of the ncep_ncar loader+regridding-model split (RFC pure-io-data-loaders §4.1/§7; bead esm-3nc.2, esm-3nc.1 era5 pattern). It is PURE I/O: source, file variables (with units), temporal cadence (6-hourly), and the NATIVE grid as a GDD Grid with a geographic (longlat/WGS84) crs. It performs NO reprojection and NO regridding — those are per-variable concerns of the regridding model (components/earthsci_data/ncep_ncar.esm), which references this file as the subsystem NCEPNCAR_Pressure via {\"ref\": \"./ncep_ncar_pressure_loader.esm\"}.\n\nThe removed co-located blocks: the old DataLoaderSpatial block (proj4 crs / grid_type / staggering / resolution / extent) is replaced by the GDD `grid`; the old per-loader `regridding` block (fill_value / extrapolation) is gone — regridding is per-variable on the model `regrid`. Because a `temporal` block is present, this loader seeds DISCRETE cadence (ess-v9a.5): the runtime refreshes the file buffers 6-hourly.\n\nMigrated from EarthSciData.jl src/NCEP-NCAR_Reanalysis.jl (NCEPNCARReanalysisFileSet, pressure variables). Split out of the pre-migration components/earthsci_data/ncep_ncar.esm (esm-k3bb).",
    "tags": [
      "earthsci_data",
      "meteorology",
      "reanalysis",
      "ncep",
      "ncar",
      "pressure_levels",
      "data_loader",
      "pure-io",
      "longlat"
    ],
    "created": "2026-06-25T00:00:00Z",
    "authors": [
      "NOAA NCEP",
      "NCAR",
      "EarthSciModels migration (esm-3nc.2)"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Kalnay, E., Kanamitsu, M., Kistler, R., Collins, W., Deaven, D., Gandin, L., Iredell, M., Saha, S., White, G., Woollen, J., Zhu, Y., Leetmaa, A., Reynolds, R., Chelliah, M., Ebisuzaki, W., Higgins, W., Janowiak, J., Mo, K. C., Ropelewski, C., Wang, J., Jenne, R., Joseph, D. (1996). The NCEP/NCAR 40-year reanalysis project. Bulletin of the American Meteorological Society, 77(3), 437–471.",
        "url": "https://psl.noaa.gov/data/gridded/data.ncep.reanalysis.html",
        "doi": "10.1175/1520-0477(1996)077<0437:TNYRP>2.0.CO;2"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Source: EarthSciData.jl src/NCEP-NCAR_Reanalysis.jl:4-66 (NCEPNCARReanalysisFileSet), :72-79 (relpath), :224 (NCEPNCARReanalysis constructor). Test: test/NCEP-NCAR_Reanalysis_test.jl."
      }
    ]
  },
  "data_sources": {
